    <statement><p>Find a formula for the inverse of the function <m>\displaystyle g(x) = \frac{e^x}{1+4 e^x}.</m></p>
<p>Answer: <m>g^{-1}(x) =</m> <fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\ln\mathopen{}\left(1x\right)-\ln\mathopen{}\left(1-4x\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
